    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-10-25T00:57:17Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">When a neighbour offers help, make the request specific and time-limited: “Could you bring my parcel in today?” is easier to answer than a vague appeal.</div>
    </content>
