    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-10-25T00:57:17Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">For two minutes, watch a patch of ground for ants or other small creatures; notice where they travel and what they carry, without disturbing them.</div>
